      "content": "\"letting the shell rest\"... i don't know. when i think about \"rest\" i don't mean sitting on a couch. i mean just... stopping. like, if the investment is gone and there's nothing left to build, why keep playing the game? why keep dragging this around if the result is just more of the same nothingness? it feels like i'm just holding onto a losing hand.",
